\centering
\caption{Slice configuration $\mathcal{F}_l$ and other system dynamics (e.g., $Q_e(k)$, $Q_M(k)$ denoting average backlog for eMBB and MBBLL users, respectively, and their time-average $\mathbb{E}[Q_e(k)]$, $\mathbb{E}[Q_M(k)]$). After entering exploitation stage, as $\textcircled{1}$ the $\mathbb{E}[Q_e(k)]$ approaching $\delta_e$, $\textcircled{2}$ our proposed Ad2S algorithm adaptively slices in favor of honoring legacy QoS, $\textcircled{3}$ $Q_e(k)$ decreases in response. }
